{"version":1,"key":"card:91","content":{"id":91,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"ES6 模块的一些特点"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"始终使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"use strict","code":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"模块始终在严格模式下运行。例如，对一个未声明的变量赋值将产生错误。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<script type=\"module\"> \n  a = 5; // error \n</script>","language":"html","uuid":"a7ad9297-078e-46ec-8e4d-d058d0be581e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"模块级作用域"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在浏览器中，对于 HTML 页面，每个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"<script type=\"module\">","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 都存在独立的顶级作用域。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"模块代码仅在第一次导入时被解析"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"顶层模块代码应该用于初始化，创建模块特定的内部数据结构"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果我们需要多次调用某些东西 —— 我们应该将其以函数的形式导出"}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"// 📁 1.js \nimport { admin } from './admin.js'; \nadmin.name = \"Pete\"; \n// 📁 2.js \nimport { admin } from './admin.js'; \nalert(admin.name); // Pete\n// 1.js 和 2.js 引用的是同一个 admin 对象 \n// 在 1.js 中对对象做的更改，在 2.js 中也是可见的_","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"99670be1-9ba8-49c7-b8cf-8ca9d3df0d79","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为该模块只执行了一次。生成导出，然后这些导出在导入之间共享"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"import.meta","code":true},{"text":"：","type":"formatted"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"import.meta"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象包含关于当前模块的信息"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在浏览器环境中，它包含当前脚本的 URL"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果它是在 HTML 中的话，则包含当前页面的 URL"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在模块中，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"this","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"undefined","code":true}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<script> \n  alert(this); // window \n</script> \n<script type=\"module\"> \n  alert(this); // undefined \n</script>","language":"html","uuid":"b0a59f98-98e0-4f6c-91d0-3d5b5b8088a0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1689174285646,"updateTime":1743303640390,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640390}}